cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Aurora: Adaptive Unified Regime-Oriented Research Architecture"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yuvraj
    family-names: Bharadia
abstract: >-
  A Python framework for regime-adaptive financial forecasting with
  point-in-time data discipline, forward-only regime estimation whose
  non-anticipation is enforced by executable test, and regime-conditioned
  conformal prediction intervals.
keywords:
  - time series forecasting
  - conformal prediction
  - hidden Markov models
  - regime switching
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-29
